If you’ve been thinking of visiting South Caicos 🇹🇨 then you should book your stay with @salterraresort . I stayed during their Food & Wine experience with @bicyclette_cookshop and the food was exceptional. 

From a FishFolk Festival with a family style feast, Rum Tasting to a thoughtfully curated 5 course dinner by Chef Kayla with her signature dishes —everything was fantastic. 

@salterraresort is the perfect balance if you want relaxation, luxury accommodations and quality food. Check out my

